  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "こういうのは鮮度が大事だ  (Freshness Is Everything Here)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "client_f": "女性客",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "student": "生徒"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When nervous newcomer Student loses control during his debut take and infuriates veteran actress Client, Muranishi apologizes profusely and offers ten million yen right on the spot to capture raw emotion in a second take.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それではゆっくりじっくりと始めてまいりましょう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "あっ、すいません、すいません！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "すいませんじゃねえよ！今日もう上がっていいっすか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "待て待て、すまなかった、本当にすまなかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "いや、別に監督が謝ることじゃないですけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "怒る気持ちは十分に分かる。でも今の君は何よりも美しい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今のこの高ぶった感情のまま、もう一本撮らせてくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "いや、ホントに不快だったんですけど！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一千万出す。こういうのは鮮度が大事だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "まあ、考えてもいいですけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとう！さすがだ、君は正真正銘のプロだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よくやった！君は天才だ！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それではゆっくりじっくりと始めてまいりましょう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now then, let us begin nice and slowly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "あっ、すいません、すいません！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh no—I am so sorry, I am sorry!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "すいませんじゃねえよ！今日もう上がっていいっすか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sorry doesn't cut it! Can I wrap for the day and go home?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "待て待て、すまなかった、本当にすまなかった。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, hold on—I am sorry, truly sorry about that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "いや、別に監督が謝ることじゃないですけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, it isn't really something for you to apologize for, Director.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "怒る気持ちは十分に分かる。でも今の君は何よりも美しい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I completely understand your anger, yet right now you look more radiant than ever.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "今のこの高ぶった感情のまま、もう一本撮らせてくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'While your emotions are still running this high, let me shoot one more scene.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "いや、ホントに不快だったんですけど！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No way, that was seriously unpleasant!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "一千万出す。こういうのは鮮度が大事だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will pay ten million yen. Freshness is everything for a scene like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "まあ、考えてもいいですけど。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well... I suppose I could consider it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとう！さすがだ、君は正真正銘のプロだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you! Just as I thought, you are a true professional to the core.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "よくやった！君は天才だ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well done, kid! You are a natural genius!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
